WEBVTT

00:05:58.854 --> 00:06:04.860
That means 90 percent of those companies
either went under, or merged,

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.655
or fell off the list altogether.

00:06:07.696 --> 00:06:11.200
And corporate death
does seem to be accelerating.

00:06:11.242 --> 00:06:15.496
The life span of a company
on the S and P 500

00:06:15.496 --> 00:06:18.332
was 61 years in the late '50s;

00:06:18.374 --> 00:06:21.710
today, it's less than 18.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:26.298
To better understand
this corporate birth-and-death dynamic,

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:30.678
I’m going to tell you
two wildly oversimplified stories.